5TH ASCENSION GAME SUMMARY ("Dance of the Leprechauns")

Vapat the Magswoman     St:18/48 Dx:18 Co:18 In:20 Wi:23 Ch:12  Chaotic
Astral Plane $:0  HP:309(309) Pw:93(211) AC:-35 Xp:27/70084262 T:54828

[This is a game I played back in May, and forgot to post YAAP.]

After several failed attempts at a wieldless monk (man, that takes
discipline), I decided to try my first rogue. I like it better than monk
(though still not as much as wizard); had a lot of fun with 4x dagger
throws and backstabbing. I used Grayswandir but next time I want to try
Stormbringer as befits my alignment.

An early =oPFSC made the quest fairly straightforward. I obeyed my "sense
that I should not return" to the Master of Thieves, but I wondered: What
would have happened if I had? Do you have to fight him and his thugs to
keep the MKoT, or does he make off with it? ;-)

I ended up with plenty of !oEH and !oGE and got pretty good HP and Pw
early on, so I didn't bother with ^magic and nurses which I usually take
the time to do.

This was the first ascension where I brought the right tools to do all the
planes correctly, including Water where I usually stumble into the portal
before I'm ready for Astral.

[Screen shot and final stats are at the bottom, after the game timeline
