LESSONS LEARNED

when attacked by horde, don't write E-square in corner of hallway
  ...fleeing creatures can run down both sides, cutting off retreat
keep good pets away from chameleon corpses just like ^poly
save !oGL until we've reached XL:14 by regular XP
  ...don't bless them after XL:16 or so (halfway to next is still too far)
little point in geno'ing a single eel species
  ...electric eels, giant eels, and krakens can all grab and drown you
pick-axe/fountain trick: once you have intrinsic, you'll attempt a teleport
  ...and if you've dropped your gear to keep it dry, you'll be without it
  ...and if your teleport control is extrinsic, it's in the pile
  ...walking back, fire/cold mon. can poof scrolls/potions you just blanked
capture the "things I've learned" list periodically, along with maps
  ...in case a mind flayer gets a shot in


